                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfcc0967-280d-3a1a-83ae-ee0ff8d7d239",
                        "entry_id": "94b29e3c-a618-38cb-af8c-ffed80196be7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "биол., мед. основной мужской половой гормон"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db074513-57f8-4230-a01c-d1c099e12f45",
                                "sense_id": "bfcc0967-280d-3a1a-83ae-ee0ff8d7d239",
                                "text": "Тестостерон против облысения ¶ Американские дерматологи Кристофер Папа и Альберт Клигмен сообщают об успешном применении мужского полового гормона тестостерона для борьбы с облысением."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d442d4f-625c-4854-ab9e-158ccb535daf",
                                "sense_id": "bfcc0967-280d-3a1a-83ae-ee0ff8d7d239",
                                "text": "Интерстициальные эндокриноциты яичка выделяют мужской половой гормон тестостерон."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7370dd44-4b58-4062-b12a-5b7c32ba2e8a",
                                "sense_id": "bfcc0967-280d-3a1a-83ae-ee0ff8d7d239",
                                "text": "Мы просто-напросто свидетели «суеверной», как сказал поэт, «и угодливой любви пожилого человека». И в том-то и дело, что система несвободы в нашем любезном отечестве предоставляет ему полную свободу разрушать значимую вещь во имя остатков своего тестостерона."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88bb71dd-7907-4168-9fe7-05533618ab09",
                        "source_entry_id": "94b29e3c-a618-38cb-af8c-ffed80196be7",
                        "source_sense_id": "bfcc0967-280d-3a1a-83ae-ee0ff8d7d239",
                        "target_lang_word": "testosterone",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "testosterone",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd02236f-b16d-338c-aa21-4e1e79e8e989",
                                        "entry_id": "a6191cc8-b850-3154-ad90-c5b09e9a36f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A steroid hormone that stimulates development of male secondary sexual characteristics, produced mainly in the testes, but also in the ovaries and adrenal cortex."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0fb2a0e-1ed3-4f92-8ca8-79f841a2c267",
                                                "sense_id": "fd02236f-b16d-338c-aa21-4e1e79e8e989",
                                                "text": "Mammalian testes contain almost no testosterone because it is sent out into the body as quickly as it is made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9797b5e7-aeb6-4671-86ad-ce945d0f08a3",
                                                "sense_id": "fd02236f-b16d-338c-aa21-4e1e79e8e989",
                                                "text": "The text recounts a 2011 experiment: Researchers tested 136 healthy young men’s testosterone levels, asked them about their political party affiliations, then gave them either a placebo or ten grams of AndroGel one percent, a high-end dose of a common form of testosterone often used in hormone replacement therapies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c13f654-9f3f-31b2-9db6-e8d040626e86",
                                        "entry_id": "a6191cc8-b850-3154-ad90-c5b09e9a36f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manly behavior, often of an aggressive or foolishly reckless nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b812b89-b3af-4925-b8e4-c1918e48a760",
                                                "sense_id": "6c13f654-9f3f-31b2-9db6-e8d040626e86",
                                                "text": "Mother encouraged James to rely more on intelligence and less on testosterone to deal with the neighbor's son."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c74a4a0-7fa4-4f96-b171-05bbac09546b",
                                                "sense_id": "6c13f654-9f3f-31b2-9db6-e8d040626e86",
                                                "text": "The MPS is a male orientated and misogynistic environment filled with testosterone, notches on bed posts and conquests."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
